      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you would prefer not to use the SteamVR skeleton for a particular controller type, you can customize your bindings in the SteamVR bindings UI to remove the skeleton binding. This would be in the \"Global\" tab (top right) -> \"Skeletons\" (bottom center-right) -> Left Hand Left skeleton / Right Hand Right skeleton. If you set both of these to \"Unused\" and save your bindings, VRChat will no longer be using the SteamVR skeleton for that controller type because it would then be unbound.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
